  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "風險模型",
    "sub_ename": "STATISTICS FOR RISK MODELING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程目標在使學生學習利用大數據資料，並運用於統計分析，課程內容包括：\n1. 了解統計的觀念與R程式語言\n2. 建立廣義線性模型(GLM)的概念\n3. 了解基礎迴歸時間序列模型的概念\n4. 了解主成分分析的概念\n5. 了解決策樹模型的概念\n6. 了解集群分析的概念\n",
    "describe_eh": "The main goal of this class is to learn the operation of statistical software in big data analysis and apply it to basic statistical models, including：1. Statistical learning and the R programming language, 2. Generalized linear models, 3. Regression-based time series models, 4. Principal components analysis, 5.Decision tree models, 6.Cluster analysis.\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
